<view class="page"><view class="safe-top"/><view class="topbar"><view><view class="brand">风里有约</view><view class="brand-sub">BEIJING · WEEKEND</view></view><view class="city-chip">⌖ 北京</view></view><view class="page-title">北京周末玩法库</view><view class="page-copy">系统精选持续维护；大家分享来自不同的出行安排，按你的状态慢慢挑。</view><scroll-view class="chip-row" scroll-x="true"><block wx:for="{{sourceTabs}}" wx:key="0"><button class="chip {{source===item[0]?'active':''}}" data-source="{{item[0]}}" bindtap="sourceTab">{{item[1]}}</button></block></scroll-view><scroll-view class="chip-row mood-chip-row" scroll-x="true"><block wx:for="{{moodTabs}}" wx:key="0"><button class="chip {{mood===item[0]?'active':''}}" data-mood="{{item[0]}}" bindtap="moodTab">{{item[1]}}</button></block></scroll-view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在整理周末方式…</view><block wx:else><block wx:if="{{routes.length}}"><block wx:for="{{routes}}" wx:key="_id"><button class="route-card" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="route-cover {{index%3===1?'orange':index%3===2?'blue':''}}"><image wx:if="{{item.cover}}" class="route-photo" src="{{item.cover}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="photo-shade"/><text class="route-tag">{{item.tag|| (item.route_kind==='place'?'🌿 去走走':'☀ 周末安排')}}</text><text class="source-badge {{item.source_type==='community'?'community':''}}">{{item.source_type==='community'?'大家分享':'系统精选'}}</text></view><view class="route-body"><view class="route-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="route-desc">{{item.description}}</view><view class="facts">⌖ {{item.district}}　◷ {{item.duration}}　¥ {{item.budget}}</view></view></button></block></block><view wx:else class="empty">这个条件下暂时没有合适的周末方案。<br/>换个方式看看吧。</view></block><button class="primary-btn discover-create" bindtap="create">发布一条你愿意分享的安排</button></view>